  "text": "Longevity, escape velocity is probably going to be reached within the next five years. As you age a year, you're gaining back more than a year. If a 90 year old person has the health of a 50 year old, then people are living longer and then social security completely collapsed, which makes sense right now. You have these things like Trump account and kids docs and stuff like that. Maybe the powers that be are foreseen. People are going to be living longer and social security is going to collapse. And it needs to be replaced by some sort of retirement fund or other sort of investment so that any kids that are alive now, when they start getting older, they have a lot of assets. Interesting world, but scary.",
